>> IKE-2.18
TEST_DESCRIPTION
Successive retransmissions of the same packet SHOULD be separated by 
increasingly longer time intervals.
Main mode/DUT initiated/Positive
TEST_REFERENCE
RFC 2408 s5.1 p58 General Message Processing
TEST_METHOD
- ANVL: Externally cause DUT to initiate an ISAKMP SA
-  DUT: Send <HDR,SA> Packet
- ANVL: Do not respond
-  DUT: Retransmit <HDR,SA> Packet
- ANVL: Do not respond. Note the time difference(T1) for
        retransmission.
-  DUT: Retransmit <HDR,SA> Packet
- ANVL: Do not respond. Note the time difference(T2) for
        second retransmission.
- ANVL: Repeat <prm_retransmit_count> times
