TEST_DESCRIPTION
IKE MAY notify INVALID-PAYLOAD-TYPE or PAYLOAD-MALFORMED for an
incoming ISAKMP packet with 2 Transforms, if Next Payload of first
Transform is not 3, or Next Payload of second is not 0.
