TEST_METHOD
- ANVL: Send <HDR,SA> Packet with 1 Proposal and two Transforms.
        Set the Next Payload field of first Transform to <NP1>
        and that of second Transform to <NP2>
-  DUT: Notify INVALID-PAYLOAD-TYPE or PAYLOAD-MALFORMED
- CASE: <NP1> = 0, <NP2> = 0
- CASE: <NP1> = 1, <NP2> = 1
- CASE: <NP1> = 3, <NP2> = 2
