TEST_DESCRIPTION
Deletion which is concerned with an ISAKMP SA will contain
Protocol ID of ISAKMP and the SPIs are CKY-I and CKY-R from
ISAKMP Header.
Main mode/ANVL initiated/Negative
TEST_REFERENCE
NEGATIVE: RFC2408 s3.15 p41 Delete Payload 
TEST_METHOD
- ANVL: Establish one ISAKMP SA with DUT
- ANVL: Send <HDR*,Hash(1),DEL> Packet to delete ISAKMP SA with
        SPI set to <prm_inv_ph1_spi_val>
-  DUT: Discard the packet because <prm_inv_ph1_spi_val> is
        an invalid SPI value
- ANVL: Send <HDR*,HASH(1),SA,Ni,KE> Packet
-  DUT: Send <HDR*,HASH(2),SA,Nr,KE> Packet
