TEST_DESCRIPTION
Deletion for IPSEC SA, such as ESP or AH, will contain the Protocol-Id 
of that protocol and the SPI is the sending entity's SPI.
Quick mode/DUT initiated/Positive
TEST_REFERENCE
RFC 2408 s3.15 p41 Delete Payload
TEST_METHOD
- ANVL: Establish one ISAKMP SA with DUT
- ANVL: Externally cause DUT to initiate an IPSEC SA
-  DUT: Send <HDR*,HASH(1),SA,Ni,KE>
- ANVL: Send <HDR*,HASH(2),SA,Nr,KE>
-  DUT: Send <HDR*,HASH(3)>
- ANVL: Externally cause DUT to delete the IPSEC SA
-  DUT: Send <HDR*,DEL> with SPI in DEL set to DUT's SPI and Protocol-Id
       in DEL set to the IPSEC Protocol (AH or ESP)
TEST_CLASSIFICATION
MUST
