- ANVL: Establish an ISAKMP SA with DUT
- ANVL: Send <HDR*,HASH(1),SA,Ni,KE> Packet with CKY-I set
        to ANVL's Cookie and CKY-R field set to 0
        in the HDR
-  DUT: Do not send <HDR*,Hash(2),SA,Nr,KE> Packet
