TEST_DESCRIPTION
IKE MUST not respond to an incoming packet with 2 Proposals, if
NP of first Proposal is not 2 or NP of second Proposal is not
0.
Quick mode/ANVL initiated/Negative
TEST_REFERENCE
NEGATIVE: RFC 2408 s3.5 p28 Proposal Payload
