- ANVL: Establish one ISAKMP SA with DUT
- ANVL: Send <HDR*,HASH(1),SA,Ni,KE> Packet with 2 Proposals with the
        Next Payload field of first Proposal set to <NP1>
        and that of second Proposal to <NP2>
-  DUT: Do not send <HDR*,Hash(2),SA,Nr,KE> packet
- CASE: <NP1> = 1, <NP2> = 1
- CASE: <NP1> = 1, <NP2> = 2
TEST_CLASSIFICATION
MUST
