TEST_DESCRIPTION
For an offer with SA lifetime longer than the responder's, the
responder SHOULD notify RESPONDER-LIFETIME, indicating its
lifetime.
Quick mode/ANVL initiated/Negative
TEST_REFERENCE
NEGATIVE: RFC 2407 s5.4 p16 Lifetime Notification
          RFC 2407 s5 p13 IPSEC Security Associations Attributes
          RFC 2409 s5.5 p18 Phase 2 - Quick Mode
TEST_METHOD
- ANVL: Establish one ISAKMP SA with DUT
- ANVL: Send <HDR*,HASH(1),SA,Ni,KE> Packet. Set SA  Attributes of
        class SA Life Duration to more than 8 hours(Default value)
-  DUT: Complete Quick Mode exchange
-  DUT: May notify RESPONDER-LIFETIME indicating the responder's
        lifetime
TEST_CLASSIFICATION
SHOULD
TEST_TOPOLOGY
TOPOLOGY-0

