TEST_METHOD
- ANVL: Establish one ISAKMP SA with DUT
- ANVL: Send <HDR*,HASH(1),SA,Ni,KE> Packet
-  DUT: Send <HDR*,HASH(2),SA,Nr,KE> Packet
- ANVL: Send <HDR*,HASH(3)> Packet
- ANVL: Wait for <paramListenTime> for SA to get stabilized
- ANVL: Send a plain ICMP Echo Request from Local Host
-  DUT: Forward the secured ICMP Echo Request to Remote Host
- ANVL: Send <HDR*,HASH(1),DEL> Packet to delete the IPSEC SA
- ANVL: Wait for <paramListenTime> for DUT to process the DEL packet
- ANVL: Send a plain ICMP Echo Request from Local Host
-  DUT: Do not forward the secured ICMP Echo Request to Remote Host
