TEST_DESCRIPTION
If the Authentication Only bit is set (1), only authentication
services will be applied to the Notify payload and it will not
be encrypted.
Quick mode/DUT initiated/Positive
TEST_REFERENCE
NEGATIVE: RFC2408 s3.1 p24 ISAKMP Header Format
TEST_METHOD
- ANVL: Establish one ISAKMP SA with DUT
- ANVL: Externally cause DUT to initiate one IPSEC SA
-  DUT: Send <HDR*,HASH(1),SA,Ni,KE> Packet
- ANVL: Send <HDR*,HASH(2),SA,Nr,KE> Packet. Set Commit bit to 1
-  DUT: Send <HDR*,HASH(3)> packet
- ANVL: Send an unsecured ICMP Echo Request from Local Host
-  DUT: Don't Forward the secured ICMP Echo Request to Remote Host
- ANVL: Send <HDR*,NOT> Packet with Notify Message CONNECTED with
        Authentication Only bit set to 1 and no HASH
- ANVL: Send an unsecured ICMP Echo Request from Local Host
-  DUT: Don't Forward the secured ICMP Echo Request to Remote Host
TEST_CLASSIFICATION
MUST
